---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Partners" description="Who Restore the Last partners with and why. Current partners and how to apply.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-white section-padding border-b border-primary/10">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="label text-primary mb-4">Partners</p>
      <div class="gold-line mb-8"></div>
      <h1 class="text-dark text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold leading-tight max-w-3xl">
        We equip the people already doing the work.
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Partners -->
  <section class="bg-offwhite section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="label text-primary mb-6">Our Approach</p>
        <h2 class="mb-8">We don't build from scratch. We multiply what works.</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          There are organizations around the world already embedded in the communities that need healing most. They have the trust, the staff, the infrastructure. What they lack is the technology.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Restore the Last bridges that gap. We find established facilities serving trauma-affected people and fund the technology — with training, support, and full outcome tracking.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Current Partners -->
  <section class="bg-white section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="label text-primary mb-6">Current Partners</p>
      <h2 class="mb-10">Where the work is happening now.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="border border-primary/10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200">
          <img
            src="/placeholder-children-playful.jpg"
            alt="Children — illustrative photo representing the populations served in El Salvador"
            class="w-full h-52 object-cover object-center"
          />
          <div class="p-8">
            <p class="label text-gold-deep mb-2">El Salvador</p>
            <h3 class="text-2xl mb-4">La Casa de mi Padre</h3>
            <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
              A Christ-centered children's home for kids separated from their families through the courts. Children, house parents, and staff all receive daily sessions — 18,000+ over two years, extending to our partner school, ONUVA. When everyone heals, the environment transforms.
            </p>
            <p class="text-primary font-bold text-sm">97% showed measurable improvement</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-primary/10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200">
          <img
            src="/ThriveOffice.png"
            alt="Thrive residential campus in Arizona"
            class="w-full h-52 object-cover object-center"
          />
          <div class="p-8">
          <p class="label text-gold-deep mb-2">Arizona, USA</p>
          <h3 class="text-2xl mb-4">Thrive</h3>
          <p class="text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
            25-acre residential campus serving aged-out foster youth ages 18–25. 55 young adults housed. Part-time practitioner delivering 25–30 sessions weekly. Residents sleeping, communicating, and earning milestones that felt impossible before.
          </p>
          <p class="text-primary font-bold text-sm">10 residents earned driver's licenses</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Target Partners -->
  <section class="bg-light section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="label text-primary mb-6">Expansion</p>
        <h2 class="mb-8">Who we're reaching next.</h2>
        <p class="text-body text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          We're building relationships with the organizations serving the people who stand to gain the most — faith-based groups, anti-trafficking networks, and international relief organizations.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 border-l-4 border-l-primary">
          <h3 class="text-h4 font-serif font-bold mb-2">Priority target: anti-trafficking and faith-based organizations</h3>
          <p class="text-body text-sm">
            Organizations working with trafficking survivors, at-risk youth, and trauma-affected communities in the developing world are our highest priority for next deployments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partner Requirements -->
  <section class="bg-white section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="label text-primary mb-6">What We Look For</p>
        <h2 class="mb-8">What makes a partner facility ready.</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-offwhite rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10">
            <p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-primary/20 mb-3" aria-hidden="true">01</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Established organization</p>
            <p class="text-body text-sm">Currently serving trauma-affected populations with existing infrastructure and staff.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-offwhite rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10">
            <p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-primary/20 mb-3" aria-hidden="true">02</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">On-site delivery model</p>
            <p class="text-body text-sm">A physical location where sessions can be administered regularly (residential preferred).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-offwhite rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10">
            <p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-primary/20 mb-3" aria-hidden="true">03</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Willing to train</p>
            <p class="text-body text-sm">At least one staff member committed to learning and administering sessions independently.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-offwhite rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10">
            <p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-primary/20 mb-3" aria-hidden="true">04</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Commitment to outcomes</p>
            <p class="text-body text-sm">Willingness to track outcomes and report data for donor transparency and program improvement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Become a Partner CTA — the full application lives at /apply -->
  <section id="apply" class="bg-offwhite section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="label text-primary mb-6">Become a Partner</p>
        <h2 class="mb-8">Think your organization could benefit?</h2>
        <p class="text-body mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          We fund the technology, the training, and the ongoing support — you bring the people and the commitment.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          The application takes about ten minutes, and we read every one personally.
        </p>
        <a href="/apply" class="btn-gold text-lg">Apply for funding</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-deep text-white section-padding text-center">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="text-white text-3xl mb-6">The work scales when more partners join.</h2>
      <a href="/give" class="btn-gold text-lg">Fund a partnership</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
